    "lines": [
      {
        "scene": "hook",
        "text": "Every chip you own is built from a Bell Labs invention.",
        "start": 0.3,
        "seconds": 3.57,
        "window": 3.87,
        "fill": 0.922
      },
      {
        "scene": "ask",
        "text": "The transistor. What did the very first one look like?",
        "start": 4.17,
        "seconds": 3.44,
        "window": 3.87,
        "fill": 0.889
      },
      {
        "scene": "lab",
        "text": "In 1947, John Bardeen and Walter Brattain built it by hand.",
        "start": 8.03,
        "seconds": 5.07,
        "window": 5.6,
        "fill": 0.905
      },
      {
        "scene": "wedge",
        "text": "Brattain wrapped gold foil around a plastic wedge and slit it at the tip with a razor.",
        "start": 13.63,
        "seconds": 5.34,
        "window": 5.77,
        "fill": 0.925
      },
      {
        "scene": "press",
        "text": "Two gold contacts, almost touching, pressed by a spring onto germanium. So how does that do anything?",
        "start": 19.4,
        "seconds": 7.09,
        "window": 7.53,
        "fill": 0.942
      },
      {
        "scene": "flow",
        "text": "A small voltage on one contact controls the current through the other.",
        "start": 26.93,
        "seconds": 4.65,
        "window": 5.13,
        "fill": 0.906
      },
      {
        "scene": "proof",
        "text": "On December sixteenth, a weak signal came out up to 100 times stronger.",
        "start": 32.07,
        "seconds": 5.18,
        "window": 5.57,
        "fill": 0.93
      },
      {
        "scene": "switch",
        "text": "Why does it matter? The same trick is a switch: a small signal turns a big current on or off.",
        "start": 37.63,
        "seconds": 6.35,
        "window": 6.83,
        "fill": 0.93
      },
      {
        "scene": "dive",
        "text": "Shrink it, copy it, and one NVIDIA Ada Lovelace graphics chip holds up to 76B of them.",
        "start": 44.47,
        "seconds": 7.16,
        "window": 7.63,
        "fill": 0.938
      },
      {
        "scene": "loop",
        "text": "All from gold foil on a plastic wedge: the switch now inside every chip in your phone.",
        "start": 52.1,
        "seconds": 5.73,
        "window": 6.27,
        "fill": 0.914
      }
    ]
  },
